    "th": "ราคารายเดือน Premium 300 ₽ / 150 Stars และ Platinum 590 ₽ / 300 Stars ได้รับการระบุไว้แล้วโดยคำนึงถึงส่วนลดเริ่มต้น 70% ชำระเงินรายปีได้ 365 วัน และลดต้นทุนได้อีกเมื่อเทียบกับการชำระเงินรายเดือน",
    "tl": "Ang mga buwanang presyo Premium 300 ₽ / 150 Stars at Platinum 590 ₽ / 300 Stars ay ipinahiwatig na nang isinasaalang-alang ang panimulang diskwento na 70%. Ang taunang pagbabayad ay magagamit sa loob ng 365 araw at higit na binabawasan ang gastos kumpara sa buwanang pagbabayad.",
    "tr": "Aylık fiyatlar Premium 300 ₽ / 150 Stars ve Platinum 590 ₽ / 300 Stars zaten%70'lik başlangıç ​​indirimi dikkate alınarak belirtilmiştir. Yıllık ödeme 365 gün boyunca mevcuttur ve aylık ödemeye kıyasla maliyeti daha da azaltır.",
